---
import BaseHead from '../components/Head/BaseHead.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Things Happening - Local Events & Guides for Your City';
const seoDescription = 'Find things to do in Chattanooga, TN: events, live music, outdoor adventures, guides, and more. Updated daily.';
---

<html lang="en" class="dot-grid-bg">
<head>
  <BaseHead title={title} description={seoDescription} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
   "@context":"https://schema.org",
   "@graph": [
      {
       "@type":"WebSite",
       "@id":"https://thingshappening.com/#website",
       "url":"https://thingshappening.com",
       "name":"Things Happening",
       "description":"Local events and guides for Chattanooga, TN."
      },
      {
       "@type":"Organization",
       "@id":"https://thingshappening.com/#organization",
       "name":"Things Happening",
       "url":"https://thingshappening.com",
       "logo": {
         "@type":"ImageObject",
         "url":"https://thingshappening.com/images/logo.png"
        },
       "contactPoint": {
         "@type":"ContactPoint",
         "email":"jack@thingshappening.com",
         "contactType":"customer support"
        }
      },
      {
       "@type":"FAQPage",
       "mainEntity": [
          {"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need an account to use Things Happening?","acceptedAnswer": {"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Everything on the site is public. No login, no account, no algorithm. Browse events and guides without signing up." } },
          {"@type":"Question","name":"Can I save events I want to attend?","acceptedAnswer": {"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Click the star on any event or guide item to save it. Starred items are stored in your browser — no account needed." } },
          {"@type":"Question","name":"How current is the event calendar?","acceptedAnswer": {"@type":"Answer","text":"The calendar rebuilds every day. Most events are added within a day or two of being announced." } },
          {"@type":"Question","name":"Can I suggest an event or venue?","acceptedAnswer": {"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Email jack@thingshappening.com with the details." } }
        ]
      }
    ]
  })} />
</head>

<body class="text-black font-body leading-normal personality-casual">
  <Nav />
  <main class="w-full px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-16 pt-8 pb-14">
    <header class="pt-8 max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="font-jakarta font-bold text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.2]">
        An easier way to find things happening in <span class="text-customGreen1">your city</span><span class="text-customGreen1">.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-black text-3xl mt-6">Currently covering Chattanooga, TN.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-4">
      <a href="/chattanooga" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-2 border-black rounded-lg px-6 py-4 text-2xl font-semibold bg-black text-white hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors w-fit">
        <span class="text-customGreen1">→</span> Chattanooga, TN
      </a>
      <!-- <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-2 border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-6 py-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-black w-fit cursor-not-allowed bg-white">
        <span>→</span> Knoxville, TN <span class="text-lg font-normal ml-2">coming soon</span>
      </div> -->
    </div>

    <section class="mt-16 max-w-3xl text-xl text-black leading-relaxed">
      <p>Chattanooga has a full calendar. There is live music nearly every night. There are trails into the mountains and kayaking on the Tennessee River. There are farmers markets, art shows, craft breweries, and coffee shops. The Southside, North Shore, Downtown, and St. Elmo each have their own rhythm. Finding all of it used to mean checking five different places.</p>

      <p class="mt-4">Things Happening puts it in one place.</p>

      <p class="mt-4">We build tools to make discovery simple.</p>

      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
        <li><a href="/chattanooga/guides/tag/interactive" class="underline hover:text-customGreen1">Interactive guides</a> with filters for every activity type</li>
        <li>An <a href="/chattanooga/" class="underline hover:text-customGreen1">events calendar</a> with tags and text search</li>
        <li>A <a href="/chattanooga/events/nearby/" class="underline hover:text-customGreen1">nearby towns calendar</a> for when you want to venture out</li>
        <li><a href="/chattanooga/guides/" class="underline hover:text-customGreen1">Downloadable PDFs</a> for offline use</li>
        <li>A <a href="/chattanooga/events/tags/" class="underline hover:text-customGreen1">tags page</a> to browse by activity</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-6">We cover Downtown Chattanooga, the North Shore, the Southside, Lookout Mountain, and nearby cities.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16 max-w-3xl text-xl text-black">
      <h2 class="font-jakarta font-bold text-3xl mb-6">Common questions<span class="text-customGreen1">.</span></h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-1">What cities does Things Happening cover?</h3>
          <p>Things Happening currently covers Chattanooga, TN and nearby towns including Cleveland, Ringgold, and Ooltewah.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-1">How do I find events in Chattanooga?</h3>
          <p>Go to the <a href="/chattanooga" class="underline hover:text-customGreen1">Chattanooga page</a>. You can filter by date window, search by keyword, or use <a href="/chattanooga/events/tags" class="underline hover:text-customGreen1">tags</a> to browse by activity.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-1">How current is the event calendar?</h3>
          <p>The calendar rebuilds every day. Most events are added within a day or two of being announced.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-1">Can I suggest an event or venue?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Email <a href="mailto:jack@thingshappening.com" class="underline hover:text-customGreen1">jack@thingshappening.com</a> with the details.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</body>
</html>
